> f(x: u4) = x ^ 5
> g(x: u4) = (x ^ 5) + (x == 15 ? 1 : 0)
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 1 point, e.g. x=15: 15 vs 0
> equiv g f
g and f differ at 1 point, e.g. x=15: 0 vs 15
> range f
range of f -> u4:
  0..15   (9 distinct values)
  values: 0..1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13, 15
  fits in u4
  over all 16 points of the domain
> range g
range of g -> u4:
  0..13   (8 distinct values)
  values: 0..1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11, 13
  fits in u4
  over all 16 points of the domain
